 | Export | Meaning |
 |---|---|
-| `rb_alloc(len) -> ptr` | reserve `len` bytes for the host to write source into |
-| `rb_release(len)` | release that buffer |
+| `rb_alloc(len) -> ptr` | reserve `len` bytes for the host to write source into; null past `MAX_SOURCE_BYTES` |
+| `rb_release(ptr) -> i32` | release that buffer by its own address; `0` released, `-1` nothing to release |
 | `rb_run(ptr, len) -> i32` | run the program; `0` ok, `1` failed, `-1` refused |
-| `rb_output_ptr()` / `rb_output_len()` | the program's output bytes |
